              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Bareyubeni n’Abagadi n’igihimba c’umuryango w’Abamanase, hārimw’ abantu b’intōre, bar’ abahinga bo gutwara inkinzo n’inkota no kurasana, b’abahinga bazi kurwana; bose na bose bār’ ibihumbi mirongwine na bine n’amajana ndwi na mirongwitandatu, bazi kurwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.18",
