        {
          "text": "banyaga amasho yabo, ingamiya ibihumbi mirongwitanu, n’intama ibihumbi amajana abiri na mirongwitanu, n’ indogoba ibihumbi bibiri; bafata mpiri abantu ibihumbi ijana. ",
