          "text": "Hanyuma iyo Mana, ari yo nyene y’Abisirayeli, ibavyukiriza Puli, umwami w’i Ashuri, hanyuma ibavyukiriza Tigulati‐pileseri, umwami w’i Ashuri nyene, abambukana ar’ inyagano, abo Bareyubeni n’Abagadi n’ab’ igihimba c’umuryango wa Manase abajana i Halaha n’i Habori n’i Hara no ku ruzi Gozani, babayo na bugingo n’ubu.",
